    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d993">

                <pb facs="1129" n="1049" xml:id="pg1049"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Sultan of Turkey to President
                    Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Yildiz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-01"><hi rendition="#italic">September 1,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have received with the keenest pleasure your excellency’s telegram expressing
                    your sincere felicitations on the occasion of the anniversary of my accession to
                    the throne. I beg you to accept my warmest thanks.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Abdul Hamid.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
